    "title": "Oil Spill Index (OSI)",
    "description": "Highlights potential oil slick signatures over Sentinel-2 coastal and marine scenes using an Oil Spill Index (OSI) band ratio, rendered as a false-color RGB composite from red-edge, NIR, and SWIR band ratios. Intended for rapid screening; results should be validated with contextual information and complementary data (e.g. SAR) to avoid confusion with look-alike phenomena such as sunglint, algae, or sediments. Converted from the Sentinel Hub Oil Spill Index evalscript. Adapted from a SentinelHub Custom Script by Sankaran Rajendran.",
